# The random opcode under the session seed, drawn two ways. The
# screen is told to be 24 lines high so that each recorded screen is
# a screenful and not the stream's 255 rows. The bell curve drops two
# balls per key, the timed read's routine ending the read once before
# the key is taken, and resets once a lane reaches the top; the spread
# draws 50 numbers between reads, two screens per key.

! SEED=1
! GAME=zcode-checkers/random.z5
! UPPER=yes
! HEIGHT=24

1
1
>
(15 lines of >)
q
2
>
>
>
>
q
q
